# Environment: Development
# Description: Environment variables for the development environment.
# Note: Do not commit sensitive information to version control.
# NOTE: this branch added VITE_STOCK_MOVEMENTS_ENDPOINT_PATH (/stockMovements),
# which the Azure mock below doesn't have yet. To test locally, temporarily
# point VITE_QULLQA_API_BASE_URL to your local json-server instead (e.g. via a
# gitignored .env.development.local override) — do not commit that override here.

